WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Gomboc pancakes from the oven. You have to try this.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.240
The taste is like plum dumplings, and they are made so simply.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:15.940
In a bowl mix one cup of flour, two eggs, 100 ml of milk, 250 ml of plain water, a little salt, one vanilla sugar and a little oil.

4
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:22.080
I whisk with a hand blender so there are no lumps, pour it into a standard baking tray and add finely chopped plums on top.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.460
It goes into the oven at 200 degrees, and meanwhile I fry 100 grams of breadcrumbs and sugar in a little butter.

6
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:33.600
When it is done, we sprinkle the breadcrumbs and sugar over it, cut, roll it up and the delicious dessert is ready.

7
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.200
I bought all the groceries, of course, at Gomex.

8
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.580
